                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": " The semantic provider incompletely reads function parameters in languages with multiple clauses (Scala), parameter groups (Dart), or receiver types (Kotlin), causing missing flows, dropped PARAM_TYPE edges, and type misidentification. Additionally, selective cache entries are not invalidated when ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "--force",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code",
