        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Solution:",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold",
                  "attrs": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": " The parser now reads every parameter clause instead of stopping at the first one, unwraps Dart parameter groups to expose their bindings, and positions-orders return-type candidates to skip receiver types in extension functions and parameter-list types. Cache entries are restructured to nest selective snapshots beneath the complete entry they derive from, enabling ",
